#: ../../AIDE/About/OStaRS.rst:12
msgid "Open Stacked Rapid Sand Filter Configurable Component"
msgstr ""

#: ../../AIDE/About/OStaRS.rst:14
msgid "Stacked Rapid Sand, StaRS, filters were invented in 2010 by the AguaClara Cornell program in response to the need for a new technology that would both eliminate the need for backwash pumps AND not require the construction of 6 filters for small towns."
msgstr ""

#: ../../AIDE/About/OStaRS.rst:23
msgid "OStaRS"
msgstr ""

#: ../../AIDE/About/OStaRS.rst:23
msgid "The open stacked rapid sand filter uses hydraulic controls to ensure steady flow through the filter media and an innovative system to inject and extract water from the sand bed to create six filters working in parallel."
msgstr ""

#: ../../AIDE/About/OStaRS.rst:33
msgid "Location of the OStaRS filter"
msgstr ""

#: ../../AIDE/About/OStaRS.rst:33
msgid "The open stacked rapid sand filter (outlined in red) is a compact unit next to the chemical platform."
msgstr ""

#: ../../AIDE/About/OStaRS.rst:37
msgid "The Stacked Rapid Sand Filter Includes Four Innovations:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../AIDE/About/OStaRS.rst:39
msgid "No pumps are required for backwash."
msgstr ""

#: ../../AIDE/About/OStaRS.rst:40
msgid "The filter switches between filtration and backwash modes without changing the flow rate through the filter."
msgstr ""

#: ../../AIDE/About/OStaRS.rst:41
msgid "A single small air valve controls changing the mode from filter to backwash and back again."
msgstr ""

#: ../../AIDE/About/OStaRS.rst:42
msgid "Water is injected into and extracted from the sand bed."
msgstr ""

#: ../../AIDE/About/OStaRS.rst:45
msgid "Generate New Models of the Stacked Rapid Sand Filter"
msgstr ""

#: ../../AIDE/About/OStaRS.rst:47
msgid "Edit the configurations to create new models of the stacked rapid sand filter. Send us `feedback to share how you are using the OStaRS model, to give us suggestions for how to make these models easier to use, and to <https://forms.gle/cqDPapYkcSmLnDu4A>`_  |reportabug|."
msgstr ""

#: ../../AIDE/About/OStaRS.rst:0
msgid "reportabug"
msgstr ""

