msgstr ""

#: ../../AIDE/About/OStaRS.rst:1
msgid "Configuration"
msgstr ""

#: ../../AIDE/About/OStaRS.rst:1
msgid "Description"
msgstr ""

#: ../../AIDE/About/OStaRS.rst:1
msgid "Flow (L/s)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../AIDE/About/OStaRS.rst:1
msgid "The maximum flow rate sets the size and number of the filters. Vary it to see how the dimensions change."
msgstr ""

#: ../../AIDE/About/OStaRS.rst:1
msgid "Minimum temperature (˚C)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../AIDE/About/OStaRS.rst:1
msgid "The temperature has a small effect on the head loss through the clean filter bed."
msgstr ""

#: ../../AIDE/About/OStaRS.rst:1
msgid "Spare Filter"
msgstr ""

#: ../../AIDE/About/OStaRS.rst:1
msgid "If selected this will add filter capacity so that one filter can be taken off line while operating at the plant maximum flow rate."
msgstr ""

#: ../../AIDE/About/OStaRS.rst:1
msgid "Fraction of clogged bed head loss"
msgstr ""

#: ../../AIDE/About/OStaRS.rst:1
msgid "A clean filter corresponds to a value of 0 and a clogged filter corresponds to a value of 1. The water levels change to reflect this head loss."
msgstr ""

#: ../../AIDE/About/OStaRS.rst:1
msgid "Filter Mode"
msgstr ""

#: ../../AIDE/About/OStaRS.rst:1
msgid "If selected the filter is in filtration mode, otherwise the filter is in backwash mode. The water levels change to reflect the filter mode."
msgstr ""

